     8449    run fill-temp-cd in this-procedure ( input g#db-num, input 'маг':U, input i-obj-code, input yes).
     8450    if can-find(first temp-cd where
     8451                     temp-cd.obj-code = i-obj-code
     8452                AND  (temp-cd.pos-type = 'IBM-XML':U
