    11298           run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "IDCLimit", input string(- cash-dis-rule.discnt-value),  input 1 ).
    11299           run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "IDCFactor", input string(cash-dis-rule.tot-sum),  input 1 ).
    11300         end.
